namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamUIBPLibrary:AddWidgetOfClassToScreen {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIBPLibrary.h#DreamUIBPLibrary:AddWidgetOfClassToScreen
    src   "Load a prefab under the shared screen root and track it as a viewport page. Return pin follows InWidgetClass."
    text  "在共享屏幕根下加载预制体，并将其作为视口页面跟踪。返回引脚的类型与InWidgetClass一致，为控件类。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIBPLibrary:AddWidgetOfClassToViewport {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIBPLibrary.h#DreamUIBPLibrary:AddWidgetOfClassToViewport
    src   "UMG-style CreateWidget + AddToViewport convenience node for a DreamUI prefab. Return pin follows InWidgetClass."
    text  "用于DreamUI预制体的UMG风格CreateWidget + AddToViewport便捷节点，可把控件添加到视口。返回引脚的类型与InWidgetClass一致。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIBPLibrary:AttachWidgetToSceneComponent {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIBPLibrary.h#DreamUIBPLibrary:AttachWidgetToSceneComponent
    src   "Put a root widget made with ConstructWidget into the world: the counterpart of AddToViewport\nfor world-space UI, and what a prefab presenter does for the tree it loads. The root must carry\na DreamCanvas (the canvas decides the render mode and owns the meshes); it is attached to\nInSceneComponent, which gives it its world transform, and leaves the not-yet-added state.\nReturns false, and changes nothing, when InRoot has a parent or no canvas."
    text  "将通过ConstructWidget创建的根控件放入世界：它是AddToViewport（加入视口）在\n世界空间UI中的对应物，也是预制体呈现器为其加载的控件树所做的事情。根控件必须带有\nDreamCanvas（由画布决定渲染模式并持有网格体）；它被附加到\nInSceneComponent场景组件上，由后者提供世界变换，并脱离尚未添加的状态。\n当InRoot已有父项或没有画布时，返回false，且不做任何更改。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIBPLibrary:BeginDeferredCreateDreamWidget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIBPLibrary.h#DreamUIBPLibrary:BeginDeferredCreateDreamWidget
    src   "The two calls the Create Dream Widget node compiles to, with its Expose on Spawn assignments in\nbetween -- the node is their face, as UMG's Create Widget is UWidgetBlueprintLibrary::Create's.\nSee BeginCreateDreamWidget for why the assignments go in the middle.\n\nBegin makes the widget and points it at OwningPlayer, refusing a controller that is not local as\nUMG does. Finish initializes and registers it and leaves it in CreateDreamWidgetOfClass's state:\nheld by the manager, off screen until it is added somewhere."
    text  "Create Dream Widget节点编译成的两个调用，中间夹着它的Expose on Spawn赋值\n——该节点是它们的门面，正如UMG的Create Widget是蓝图函数库UWidgetBlueprintLibrary::Create的门面。\n赋值为何放在中间，请参见BeginCreateDreamWidget。\n\nBegin创建控件并将其指向OwningPlayer，像UMG那样拒绝非本地的控制器。\nFinish初始化并注册它，使其处于CreateDreamWidgetOfClass的状态：\n由管理器持有，在添加到某处之前不在屏幕上。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIBPLibrary:ConstructWidget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIBPLibrary.h#DreamUIBPLibrary:ConstructWidget
    src   "Make a widget that exists but is not on screen -- the counterpart of UMG's\nWidgetTree::ConstructWidget<T>(). It draws nothing and its behaviours do not run until you\nhand it to AddChild or AddToViewport; until then it is held by the DreamUI manager, so it will\nnot be collected out from under you while you configure it.\n\nVisualClass is what the widget looks like (DreamImage, DreamText, ...). Leave it null for a bare\nwidget, which is what a pure container is. Give it a layout container afterwards to make it a\npanel -- in this fork \"panel\" is a subobject, not a separate class."
}

DreamUIBPLibrary:CreateDreamWidgetOfClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIBPLibrary.h#DreamUIBPLibrary:CreateDreamWidgetOfClass
    src   "Instantiate a prefab without putting it anywhere -- the counterpart of UMG's\nCreateWidget(WidgetBlueprintClass). Same not-on-screen state as ConstructWidget, including a\nprefab whose root carries its own UDreamCanvas, which would otherwise start rendering the\nmoment it existed.\n\nThe prefab's own logic lives on the root widget's behaviour components, so reach it with\nGetComponent rather than by casting the returned pointer.\n\nThe return pin takes the shape of InWidgetClass, so a Blueprint subclass's own variables and\nfunctions are reachable without a Cast, as with UMG's Create Widget node.\n\nNot in the Blueprint menu, as UWidgetBlueprintLibrary::Create is not: the Create Dream Widget node\nstands for it there and offers the class's Expose on Spawn properties as well. A graph that already\ncalls it keeps compiling."
    text  "实例化一个预制体，但不将其放到任何位置——即UMG的\nCreateWidget(WidgetBlueprintClass)的对应物。与ConstructWidget一样处于不在屏幕上的状态，包括\n根节点自带UDreamCanvas的预制体，否则它一存在\n就会开始渲染。\n\n预制体自身的逻辑位于根控件的行为组件上，因此请用\nGetComponent访问它，而不是对返回的指针进行类型转换。\n\n返回引脚采用InWidgetClass的类型，因此无需Cast即可访问蓝图子类自己的变量和\n函数，与UMG的Create Widget节点相同。\n\n不在蓝图菜单中，正如UWidgetBlueprintLibrary::Create也不在其中：在那里由Create Dream Widget节点\n代表它，并且还提供该类的Expose on Spawn属性。已经在\n调用它的图表仍可继续编译。"
    state machine
}

