DreamUIBPLibrary:ForceLayoutPrepass {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIBPLibrary.h#DreamUIBPLibrary:ForceLayoutPrepass
    src   "Lay this widget's tree out NOW rather than on the next pass -- UMG's ForceLayoutPrepass.\n\nThe manager has done this since the beginning; it simply had no Blueprint face, and the manager\nitself is not a Blueprint type, so a graph that needed a size before the frame ended had no way\nto ask. Use it when you have just changed content and need the resulting size in the same frame."
    text  "立即布局此控件的树，而不是等到下一轮——即UMG的ForceLayoutPrepass。\n\n管理器从一开始就这样做；只是它没有蓝图接口，而管理器\n本身也不是蓝图类型，因此需要在帧结束前拿到尺寸的图表无从\n询问。当你刚修改了内容并需要在同一帧内得到结果尺寸时使用它。"
    state machine
}

