DreamUIDuplicateDataContainer {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/DreamUIBPLibrary.h#DreamUIDuplicateDataContainer
    src   "What PrepareDuplicateData hands to DuplicateWidgetWithPreparedData.\n\nIt used to carry a serialised blob, because duplication meant a save/load round trip and the point\nof preparing was to pay for the save once. Duplication instances the template now, so there is\nnothing to prepare: the template itself is the data, and the pair is kept because Blueprints call\nit and because holding the template strongly is what keeps it alive between the two calls."
    text  "PrepareDuplicateData 交给 DuplicateWidgetWithPreparedData 的内容，用于复制控件。\n\n它过去携带一个序列化的数据块，因为复制意味着一次保存/加载往返，而\n准备的意义在于只支付一次保存的开销。现在复制控件会实例化模板，因此没有\n需要准备的东西：模板本身就是数据；保留这一对函数，是因为蓝图会调用\n它，而且强引用模板正是让它在两次调用之间保持存活的原因。"
    state machine
}

